'''Kat''' is an [[NPC]] who resides in the {{zone|Pet Care}}. She takes care of the player's [[Pets]] for a duration of time, upgrading their rarity: cumulative experience remains the same, although the level of the pet will be adjusted accordingly. Only one pet can be taken care of at a time, and each pet has different upgrade costs and durations.

The usage of a {{Item|Kat Flower}} or {{Item|Kat Bouquet}} can skip {{Green|1d}} and {{Green|5d}} of the time taken to upgrade a pet.

The cost of upgrading a pet is level dependent, each level removes 0.3% of the upgrade cost.

